EXTENSION "ArM5_Dies_Irae_Fimbulwinter_MagnusNornMedianMuspelliOfUrdurEtinMod" {
    NAME "Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Dies Irae - Magnus Norn: Median Muspelli of Urdur, Etin-Mod"
